				"Take a selfie from a top-to-bottom perspective in a Disney 3D cartoon style. The character is laughing joyfully, and their face appears funny due to the distortion caused by the super-wide-angle spherical lens with a fish-eye effect. Capture the character's exaggerated features and the warped perspective of the scene. The background should feature recognizable tourist attractions with slight distortion, emphasizing the lens effect. The image should have a playful and whimsical atmosphere, vibrant colors, and a clear focus on the character's humorous expression. high quality, ultra detailed, sharp focus"
